{
  "clauses": [
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-001]",
      "body": "2. The filter shall require a non-empty namespace representing the entity being filtered. *(S1)*",
      "bodySha256": "f6960f1bfb9c7d66c2899acd1c42efbfe3b046f7ee01292b35fad473ff17f335",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-001",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 1,
      "source": {
        "line": 197,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-002]",
      "body": "3. The filter shall allow one or more attributes to be selected and explicitly ordered, and shall\n  require at least one selected attribute. *(S1)*",
      "bodySha256": "0aee05f35be2a5fbfe5bbf2159ec439ff019f18fda4ae65cb58591889cdedb69",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-002",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 2,
      "source": {
        "line": 199,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-003]",
      "body": "4. The filter shall provide top, bottom, and range limit modes. *(S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "ff35b137be384acba6a30d27cbcc3f407ef48e64fe26c1e5b3898a1ac1524b07",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-003",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 3,
      "source": {
        "line": 201,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-004]",
      "body": "5. Top and bottom modes shall require a positive integer N and represent the first or last N rows.\n  *(S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "eda91dbf8017bfca161f0950442ea13727fedd73bf0956e67989eaa9f6de0724",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-004",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 4,
      "source": {
        "line": 202,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-005]",
      "body": "6. Range mode shall require positive integer start and end values, include both endpoints, and\n  require start to be less than or equal to end. *(S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "163aa589263fb216c0ab154b32d02b5261798f1f4ff20b3a76ab3bfff294ae08",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-005",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 5,
      "source": {
        "line": 204,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-006]",
      "body": "7. A new filter shall default to top mode with N equal to 10. *(S1, S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "6a4df57c371de43c8cbdd2a716e689b812d73c327c26788e71c0aa9444520f83",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-006",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 6,
      "source": {
        "line": 206,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-007]",
      "body": "8. Invalid namespace, attribute, or limit values shall produce visible validation feedback and\n  leave the filter invalid until corrected. *(S1, S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "4e58cb1cf95b27b70d4c6f41c2b3498aff15468d92b0b7cdfd4a5e71b7621486",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-007",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 7,
      "source": {
        "line": 207,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-008]",
      "body": "Acceptance criteria use the same stable, namespaced form:\n\n- The filter block is visible on the existing rule-authoring screen at desktop viewport 1440x900.\n  *(S1)*",
      "bodySha256": "4e611f15561f98d359dadc605b40e6cab5b689ae9ff8b56571e6ace24c132762",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-008",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 8,
      "source": {
        "line": 209,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:AC-001]",
      "body": "- An empty namespace is rejected and an entity name such as `customer` is accepted. *(S1)*",
      "bodySha256": "7c1a52c5cbfe7f7ac779c431d92846acf0966fa6f36a196654bf7d666a4dbb56",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:AC-001",
