    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:AC-005]",
      "body": "## Non-functional requirements\n\nLatency, throughput, availability, accessibility, privacy, retention. State the number and how it\nwill be measured; \"fast\" is not a requirement.\n\nThe filter block and its validation feedback shall remain usable at the required desktop viewport\nof 1440x900 without obscuring the rule-authoring controls. *(S1, S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "daf99436122589e8609acf1562a381646ffc7c8ca29cd1b18892f11e60c2b204",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:AC-005",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 5,
      "source": {
        "line": 221,
        "path": "singularity/work-items/filter-app/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "AC"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[filter-app:REQ-009]",
      "body": "## Constitution articles\n\nNo constitution article IDs were supplied by the governed inputs for this work item.\n\n## Assumptions\n\nThe existing rule-authoring screen already provides the surrounding rule context and attribute\nsource needed by the filter block. The requested screenshot is captured at desktop viewport\n1440x900.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nChanging the existing rule-authoring navigation, adding new permissions, defining server-side query\nexecution, changing unrelated rule types, or supporting viewport evidence other than the requested\n1440x900 screenshot.",
      "bodySha256": "edb26018c845ffac86478af0b7a031b288f2b11908c5a97b409491a1fb35d946",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "FILTER-APP:REQ-009",
      "namespace": "FILTER-APP",
      "number": 9,
